{#
  Two small round contact buttons in the bottom right corner, only on
  phones. They appear once the hero (which has its own WhatsApp button)
  is out of view and slide away again at the contact section.

  The first tap only unfolds the label, the second one opens WhatsApp or
  the phone app – so a thumb brushing past while scrolling does nothing
  (modules/mobile-cta.js). Without JavaScript they work as plain links.
#}
<div class="mobile-cta" id="mobileCta">
  <a class="mcta mcta-tel" href="{{ contactLinks.phone }}">
    {% icon "phone", "" %}
    <span class="mcta-label">Anrufen</span>
  </a>
  <a class="mcta mcta-wa" href="{{ contactLinks.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    {% icon "whatsapp", "" %}
    <span class="mcta-label">WhatsApp öffnen</span>
  </a>
</div>
